    description: "Phase 2 of ADR-0027. Replace consumer-side hardcoded *KIND* sets with calls to symbol_kinds_on_axis() or the composed (kind, edge_type, meta) shape from ADR-0027 §3.\n\nKnown consumer surfaces from ADR-0027 §\"Phase 2\":\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/ranking.py — _CALLABLE_KINDS, _NODE_KIND_WEIGHTS-shape tables\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/slice.py — _CONTAINER_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/sketch.py — KEY_SYMBOL_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/entrypoints.py — _CALLABLE_KINDS, _ROUTE_KINDS, _SEMANTIC_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/selection/filters.py — EXCLUDED_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/cli.py — _DEPENDENCY_KINDS, _NOISE_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/registry.py — SYNTHETIC_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/containment.py — CONTAINABLE_KINDS, CONTAINER_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/vue_template_method.py — _HANDLER_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/js_module.py — _EXPORTABLE_KINDS\n- packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/js_ts.py — _DECORATOR_KINDS\n\nPhase 1 registry landed in PR #3546. Each consumer migration is reversible: the old kind semantics produce the right answer with the new query shape. This phase can land before producer migration begins.\n\nReference: docs/adr/0027-symbol-kind-language-construct-only.md §\"Phase 2\"."  # c718
