  message: "Slice 2+ scope (post-Wave-5 dual-shape migration of at-risk Symbol.kind consumer surfaces flagged in slice 1's audit comments):\n\n- linkers/containment.CONTAINABLE_KINDS / CONTAINER_KINDS — values still emitted by live producers (proto.py, thrift.py, capnp.py for service/rpc/message; framework linkers for event_subscriber-shaped roles).\n- selection.EXCLUDED_KINDS — same shape; consumes the post-fold kind=function|method + meta.framework_role pattern.\n\nMigration shape: replace hard-coded *KIND* sets with symbol_kinds_on_axis(...) queries (or the dual-shape predicate idiom slice 1 introduced for SYNTHETIC_KINDS). After Wave 5 completed (Codeberg #3572 + selfh #162-#166) and the WI-nitil + phoenix_ipc.py f-string-form follow-ons closed the framework_role producer-side leak, these surfaces' producers now emit the post-fold shape consistently — slice 2 is unblocked."  # b75b
